{"step_index":330,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-28T02:35:50Z","thinking":"**Analyzing BNI Candidates**\n\nI've got the initial results! It looks like there are four BNI-related candidates in the Busan area. I've compiled them: `603-13-72550: 비엔아이 (부산)`, `607-86-14707: (주)비엔아이 (부산)`, `682-87-03270: 비엔아이개발 주식회사 (부산)`, and `606-37-39`. Now I need to dig deeper into each one.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Inspect details of all Busan BNI candidates.","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"import urllib.request\nimport urllib.parse\nimport re\n\nheaders = {\n    'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\n}\n\ncandidates = ['6031372550', '6078614707', '6828703270', '6063739691', '6210984396']\n\nfor c in candidates:\n    url = f\"https://bizno.net/article/{c}\"\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, headers=headers)\n    try:\n        with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=3) as resp:\n            html = resp.read().decode('utf-8', errors='ignore')\n            # Extract company name, CEO, address, status, business type\n            title = re.search(r'<title>(.*?)</title>', html)\n            table_text = re.sub(r'<[^>]+>', ' ', html)\n            clean_text = ' '.join(table_text.split())\n            print(f\"=== {c} ===\")\n            print(\"Title:\", title.group(1) if title else '')\n            # find key fields\n            for key in ['대표자', '상태', '주소', '업종', '법인등록번호']:\n                m = re.search(rf'{key}\\s*([^\\s]+(?:\\s+[^\\s]+){{0,5}})', clean_text)\n                if m:\n                    print(f\"  {key}: {m.group(0)}\")\n            print(\"-\" * 50)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error {c}: {e}\")\n","Description":"Inspect Busan BNI candidates","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\6849e2